---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Research" description="Ismail El Jamiy's PhD research on Handwritten Text Recognition of medieval Arabic scientific manuscripts and dedicated LLMs.">

  <!-- ── Page hero ─────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="ph-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ph-inner">
      <span class="ph-eyebrow">PhD Research · 2025–2028</span>
      <h1 class="ph-title">Research</h1>
      <p class="ph-sub">
        Making eight centuries of Arabic scientific manuscripts computationally
        accessible — beginning with al-Bīrūnī's <em>al-Qānūn al-Mas'ūdī</em>.
      </p>
      <div class="ph-badges">
        <span class="page-badge">PhD in AI · IRIT / IMT / CLLE</span>
        <span class="ph-loc">University of Toulouse · 2025–2028</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Page body ──────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="page-body">

    <!-- Opening -->
    <section class="opening-section reveal">
      <p class="drop-cap">
        The Arabic scientific tradition carries eight centuries of knowledge in astronomy, algebra,
        and medicine. My PhD makes these manuscripts computationally accessible, beginning with
        al-Bīrūnī's <em>al-Qānūn al-Mas'ūdī</em> (written c. 1030) as a first corpus.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Challenges -->
    <section class="section-block">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <span class="section-label">The problem space</span>
        <h2 class="section-h2">What makes this hard</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="challenge-grid">

        <div class="challenge-card reveal" data-delay="0">
          <div class="challenge-img">
            <!-- Arabic manuscript with multiple calligraphic hands (Cleveland Museum of Art) -->
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720701574961-320111f1181c?w=600&q=80&fit=crop"
                 alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="challenge-img-overlay"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-body">
            <div class="challenge-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Calligraphic diversity</h3>
            <p>Six copies, six hands. Each scribe used a distinct style with elongation strokes and unique ligatures.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card reveal" data-delay="0.1">
          <div class="challenge-img">
            <!-- Illuminated Arabic manuscript, Qur'an folio, 1100s Seljuq Iran (Cleveland Museum of Art) -->
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720701575003-51dafcf39cb4?w=600&q=80&fit=crop"
                 alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="challenge-img-overlay"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-body">
            <div class="challenge-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Scientific vocabulary</h3>
            <p>Astronomical and mathematical terms absent from any modern Arabic training corpus.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card reveal" data-delay="0.2">
          <div class="challenge-img">
            <!-- Qur'an folio, Mamluk Egypt 1300s — illustrates copies across eight centuries (Cleveland Museum of Art) -->
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720701574998-d68020bce2bd?w=600&q=80&fit=crop"
                 alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="challenge-img-overlay"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-body">
            <div class="challenge-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Eight centuries of copying</h3>
            <p>The same text survives in copies from the 12th to the 19th century. Models must generalise across all of them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card reveal" data-delay="0.3">
          <div class="challenge-img">
            <!-- Aged manuscript page with antique Arabic/Persian script and visible wear -->
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1634630487525-84df162e5305?w=600&q=80&fit=crop"
                 alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="challenge-img-overlay"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-body">
            <div class="challenge-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="9.5" y1="15.5" x2="14.5" y2="15.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Document wear</h3>
            <p>Water stains, faded ink, marginal annotations and physical damage introduce significant noise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pipeline -->
    <section class="section-block">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <span class="section-label">System design</span>
        <h2 class="section-h2">The pipeline</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pipeline reveal">
        {[
          { n: '01', label: 'Manuscript image', sub: 'Raw scan input', icon: 'M3 3h18v18H3z M8.5 8.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3z M21 15l-5-5L5 21' },
          { n: '02', label: 'HTR model',        sub: 'Vision-language', icon: 'M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z M12 9a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6z' },
          { n: '03', label: 'Transcription',    sub: 'Arabic text output', icon: 'M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z M14 2v6h6 M16 13H8 M16 17H8' },
          { n: '04', label: 'Medieval LLM',     sub: 'Search & translation', icon: 'M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z' },
        ].map((step, i) => (
          <div class="pipe-step">
            <div class="pipe-num">{step.n}</div>
            <div class="pipe-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                {step.icon.split(' M').map((d, j) => <path d={j === 0 ? d : 'M' + d} />)}
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="pipe-label">{step.label}</span>
            <span class="pipe-sub">{step.sub}</span>
            {i < 3 && <div class="pipe-connector" aria-hidden="true">→</div>}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Approach -->
    <section class="section-block">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <span class="section-label">Methodology</span>
        <h2 class="section-h2">My approach</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-tabs reveal" role="tablist">
        <button class="approach-tab active" role="tab" aria-selected="true"  data-panel="0"><span class="tab-num">01</span>Dataset</button>
        <button class="approach-tab"        role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-panel="1"><span class="tab-num">02</span>Language models</button>
        <button class="approach-tab"        role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-panel="2"><span class="tab-num">03</span>Pipeline</button>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-panels">
        <div class="approach-panel active" id="panel-0" role="tabpanel">
          <strong>ATHAAR</strong> is the first manually annotated benchmark for medieval Arabic scientific manuscript recognition. It compiles 1,031 lines from six witnesses of al-Bīrūnī's <em>al-Qānūn</em>, spanning the 12th to 19th century, held at institutions including the Bibliothèque nationale de France and the British Library.
        </div>
        <div class="approach-panel" id="panel-1" role="tabpanel">
          Once text is recognised, the goal is language models pre-trained on medieval Arabic scientific prose. Standard Arabic LLMs struggle with archaic vocabulary and domain-specific terminology. A dedicated model enables accurate translation, semantic search, and scholarly indexing.
        </div>
        <div class="approach-panel" id="panel-2" role="tabpanel">
          Beyond models, the goal is a usable tool: historians submit a manuscript image and get a searchable, correctable transcription. Accessibility for non-technical scholars is a first-class requirement.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Institutions -->
    <div class="inst-row reveal">
      <span class="inst-tag">IRIT</span>
      <span class="inst-tag">IMT</span>
      <span class="inst-tag">CLLE</span>
      <span class="inst-text">University of Toulouse · 2025–2028</span>
    </div>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import Lenis from 'lenis';
  import gsap from 'gsap';
  import { ScrollTrigger } from 'gsap/ScrollTrigger';
  import { inView } from 'motion';

  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

  const lenis = new Lenis({
    duration: 1.2,
    easing: (t: number) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t)),
  });
  lenis.on('scroll', ScrollTrigger.update);
  gsap.ticker.add((time) => lenis.raf(time * 1000));
  gsap.ticker.lagSmoothing(0);

  gsap.from('.ph-inner > *', {
    y: 22, opacity: 0, stagger: 0.12, duration: 0.85, ease: 'power3.out', delay: 0.12,
  });

  inView('.reveal', (element) => {
    const el = element as HTMLElement;
    const delay = parseFloat(el.dataset?.delay ?? '0');
    gsap.from(el, { y: 28, opacity: 0, duration: 0.65, delay, ease: 'power2.out', clearProps: 'all' });
  }, { amount: 0.12 });

  // Tabs
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.approach-tab');
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.approach-panel');
  tabs.forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const idx = tab.dataset.panel;
      tabs.forEach(t => { t.classList.remove('active'); t.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false'); });
      panels.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
      tab.classList.add('active');
      tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      document.getElementById(`panel-${idx}`)?.classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  /* ── Hero extras ────────────────────────────────── */
  .ph-badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .ph-loc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  /* ── Opening ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .opening-section { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .drop-cap {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .drop-cap::first-letter {
    font-size: 4.5em;
    line-height: 0.78;
    float: left;
    margin-right: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  /* ── Section blocks ─────────────────────────────── */
  .section-block { margin-bottom: 4rem; }

  .section-heading { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  /* ── Challenge cards ────────────────────────────── */
  .challenge-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .challenge-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-panel);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25,1,.5,1),
                box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25,1,.5,1);
  }
  .challenge-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 12%, transparent);
  }

  .challenge-img {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16/7;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .challenge-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: sepia(0.1) saturate(0.88);
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25,1,.5,1);
  }
  .challenge-card:hover .challenge-img img { transform: scale(1.06); }
  .challenge-img-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 30%, rgba(20,19,15,0.5) 100%);
  }

  .challenge-body { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; }

  .challenge-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-terracotta) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .challenge-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .challenge-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Pipeline ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .pipeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    background: var(--bg-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pipe-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .pipe-step:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-olive) 4%, transparent); }
  .pipe-step:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 15%;
    height: 70%;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .pipe-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .pipe-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-olive) 10%, transparent);
    border: 1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-olive) 25%, transparent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--color-olive);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .pipe-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .pipe-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .pipe-connector { display: none; }

  /* ── Approach tabs ──────────────────────────────── */
  .approach-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .approach-tab {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    margin-bottom: -2px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .approach-tab:hover { color: var(--fg); }
  .approach-tab.active { color: var(--color-olive); border-bottom-color: var(--color-olive); }

  .tab-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .approach-panels {
    background: var(--bg-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .approach-panel {
    display: none;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .approach-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* ── Institutions ───────────────────────────────── */
  .inst-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .inst-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-olive) 10%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-olive) 22%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-olive);
  }
  .inst-text { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--fg-muted); }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .challenge-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pipeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .pipe-step:nth-child(2)::after { display: none; }
    .approach-tabs { overflow-x: auto; }
  }
</style>
